          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145561,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>playerHealth</code> değerinin <code>maxHealth</code> değerinden küçük veya eşit olması durumunda metni görüntüleyen bir karşılaştırma yaz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;maxHealth&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" maxHealth = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (playerHealth &lt;= maxHealth) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Health is within limits&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>playerHealth</code>, ardından <code>&lt;=</code> ve son olarak <code>maxHealth</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
