          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145565,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>if</code> / <code>else</code> ifadesinin, <code>if</code> ifadesinin koşulu <code>false</code> olduğunda çalışan kısmına ne ad veririz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bir <code>else</code> ifadesi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Böyle bir koşul yok</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Bir <code>if</code> ifadesi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bir <code>else</code> ifadesi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145566,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"paused\"</code>'a eşit olup olmadığını kontrol eden, kod bloğu içermeyen boş bir <code>if</code> ifadesi ve ardından boş bir <code>else</code> ifadesi kodla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else (gameState !== &quot;paused)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameState === \" /><text value=\"&quot;paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>if</code>, ardından <code>(gameState === \"paused\")</code> ve sonra <code>}</code>, <code>else</code>, <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
